# The frontend currently reads no environment variables, so no frontend/.env is needed.
#
# API calls go to the same origin under /api:
#   - local dev: vite.config.ts proxies /api to http://localhost:4000 (the backend)
#   - production: frontend/vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the deployed backend
# Same-origin calls keep the httpOnly session cookie working without CORS cookie setup.
#
# All secrets and configuration live in backend/.env (see backend/.env.example).
# Never put secrets in a VITE_* variable: Vite inlines them into the public JS bundle.
